    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined after inspectors documented that she had posted on her VKontakte profile an image depicting “two men of the same sex kissing”. The exact content is unavailable. The same individual was fined at least three times by the same judge on the same day for posting images.</dataout:hasSnippet>
