    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">Journalist Yuri Dud was fined for his interview with an artist, Fedor Pavlov-Andreevich, who spoke about homophobia in Russia during the interview. The court found that this interview “with an open homosexualist and activist who emigrated from Russia” promoted “non-traditional sexual relations among minors.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
