        </dataout:penaltyValue>
      </dataout:Penalty>
    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for administering a social media group “Kids against homophobia” in VKontakte, where he posted such messages as “Love each other…”, “Love conquers all…”, and “It’s nicest to fall asleep hugging your loved one…”, attaching photos of two hugging teenagers, two sleeping teenagers, and two kissing teenagers. The court viewed these posts to be “portraying same-sex relationships as emotionally and aesthetically appealing to minors”.</dataout:hasSnippet>
