    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The online marketplace “Wildberries” was fined for several items “promoting non-traditional sexual relationships”: “2018 Calendar. Erotica-2”, the book “First Orgasm in My Life. From the ‘Diary of a Latent Lesbian’ series” by Olga Serebryanskaya, “30x40 painting on canvas on a wooden stretcher”, and “Flag/Rainbow Flag/Non-traditional Flag 90x150”. The court concluded that these items were “aimed at developing non-traditional sexual attitudes in minors” because they were sold without age restriction.</dataout:hasSnippet>
