    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for a 15-second TikTok video. The video showed the defendant “wearing headphones, glasses, and a black T-shirt — moving to music while text appeared on screen”. Although the court repeatedly stated that the text was central to the offence, its wording was not reproduced in the judgment. By the time police opened proceedings, the original TikTok post had already been deleted, but officers testified that the clip had spread to Telegram channels. The same individual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos.</dataout:hasSnippet>
