    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">Two men were prosecuted for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations, which included oral sex in a public place” (see also case 05-0486/2024). The defendant in this case, a foreign national, was also ordered to leave the country.</dataout:hasSnippet>
