    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The deputy director and producer of the TV channel “TV Tsentr – Moscow” was fined for “broadcasting a programme demonstrating non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences”, labelled “16+”. It was the episode “The beauty queens” of the programme “The Nineties” (2016), which showed photos of Martina Navratilova, a tennis player, with her wife. The TV channel was also fined for the same programme (see case 05-0067/2025).</dataout:hasSnippet>
