    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations” by wearing women's clothing while being on a tram. The court stated that “these actions deviate from generally accepted, established norms of behaviour in ordinary society and distort the perception of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations, which also contributes to the emergence of interests in society and the formation of persistent stereotypes, including immoral ones.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
