    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for posting on a Telegram channel. The court stated that the user “being male, repeatedly posted photos and videos of himself in women's clothing and makeup, and videos of himself engaging in non-traditional sexual acts with another male”, which constituted the “promotion of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences or sex change.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
