    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The editor-in-chief of the TV channel “Fon Music” was fined for airing a music video 698 times, which “contained information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations,” expressed in a scene of “kissing between two persons of the same biological sex (female)”. The exact video is unknown.</dataout:hasSnippet>
