    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The company that owns the streaming service “Ivi” was fined for the films “It's Only the End of the World” (Xavier Dolan, 2016) and “Wheel of Fortune and Fantasy” (Ryusuke Hamaguchi, 2021), labelled “16+”. The court found that these films “contained information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, which is prohibited for distribution among children.” It is not specified which scenes exactly constituted the violation.</dataout:hasSnippet>
