    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">Two women were fined for a video on social media, in which they “kissed in a cafe“, the mass media reported. According to the press office of the courts of Krasnodar Krai, the video depicted “indecent behaviour in a public place”. The court did not publish the court decision. See also case 5-55/2024.</dataout:hasSnippet>
