    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for posting the following text on Telegram: “Beloved, today is Transgender Visibility Day. Many people dear to my heart remain in Russia, and knowing their (and yours—you'll read it) wishes, I would say this: may the Russian authorities finally celebrate Transgender Visibility Day and stop this injustice. We once achieved visibility, rights, and an easy transition process. We will definitely achieve this again, much faster than the first time. Until then, may your visibility and noticeability be 110% under your control. Love.” According to the court, this post contained “information about non-traditional sexual relations”.</dataout:hasSnippet>
