    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The deputy general director of the online streaming platform “Okko” was fined for distributing the film “Abduction 101” (Steve Noir, Robin Entreinger, 2019). According to Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, this film demonstrated “non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences.” It is not specified what scenes exactly constituted the violation. The mass media reported that a case was initiated against the company that owns the platform for the same film.</dataout:hasSnippet>
