    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for posting a video on Telegram of himself climbing on a sculpture group “Metrostroevtsy” and kissing a male figure on the lips, which authorities qualified as the dissemination of information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations. According to the judicial expertise, “the said video contains signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual preferences, namely sexual relations directed at an inanimate object, as well as a realistic depiction of a person of the same sex as the participant in the action.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
