      </dataout:Penalty>
    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A VKontakte user was fined for a picture of “kissing men”. According to the judicial expertise, this picture “contained psychological and linguistic signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations (male homosexuality) and non-traditional sexual preferences (transvestism, transsexualism),” and that the author had “communicative goal to attract interest and form sexual attitudes, readiness for non-traditional sexual preferences and relationships.” The exact picture is unknown. This individual was fined three times for publishing pictures on VK by the same judge on the same day.</dataout:hasSnippet>
