    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">Beauty-blogger Igor Sinyak was fined after authorities concluded that content on his Telegram channel promoted non-traditional sexual relations online. The blogger successfully appealed this case in the higher instance, and the fine was cancelled. The case was overruled due to “violations committed by the police and the court of first instance”, as the media reported.</dataout:hasSnippet>
