    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on a website for trans women escorts. The court decision stated that the profile was “aimed at developing non-traditional sexual relations” because its creator, “being a male, writes about himself in the feminine gender”, and “posts photos in a female guise with exposed female breasts and male genitalia (penis), with dark long hair and makeup.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
