    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A Kyrgyzstan citizen was arrested for 24 hours and sentenced to an administrative expulsion for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences or sex change” via the internet.  The court did not specify the exact content that constituted the violation.</dataout:hasSnippet>
