    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The online streaming service “Tricolor Kino i TV Online” was fined for showing the film “Blow Dry” (2001, Paddy Breathnach) labelled “16+” with a 10-second scene (01:21:47-01:21:57) of “two same-sex characters (female) kissing in a sexual context”, which the court found to be the “demonstration of non-traditional sexual relationships to minors.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
