    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The TV channel “TV-21M” was fined for broadcasting the film “The Girl with a Bracelet” (2020, Stéphane Demoustier). The court found that the film, aired three times with a 16+ label, “contained material demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations […] prohibited for minors”. The exact scenes that constituted the violation are not specified.</dataout:hasSnippet>
