    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The streaming platform “Okko” was held administratively liable for the film “Triggered” (2019, Christopher Moore). The judicial expertise established that “the genre, plot, and expressive means used [in the film] aimed at fostering a positive attitude toward non-traditional sexual relationships and/or preferences; The depicted same-sex relationships and the storyline are structured in such a way as to create a socio-psychological attitude not only toward the attractiveness of non-traditional sexual relationships and/or preferences, but also to foster a distorted perception of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relationships”. The deputy general director of the streaming platform was also fined for the same film (see case 5-1663/2025-162).</dataout:hasSnippet>
    <dataout:hasTriggerObject rdf:resource="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#554100"/>
    <dataout:mentionedIn>
      <dataout:Source rdf:about="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#mentioned_in_183c1120">
        <dcterms:creator xml:lang="en">Novaya Gazeta Europe on Telegram</dcterms:creator>
        <dcterms:creator xml:lang="ru">Новая Газета Европа в Телеграм</dcterms:creator>
