    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The TV channel “ZHARA TV” was fined for airing the music video “Prisoner” by Miley Cyrus ft. Dua Lipa (2020), labelled “16+”. According to the court, the music video “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relationships and attitudes to minors.” The exact scenes that constituted the violation are not specified.</dataout:hasSnippet>
