    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A VKontakte user was fined for publishing six videos between 2012 and 2015: the music video “Cliffs Edge” by Hayley Kiyoko (2015) and other videos titled “boys kissing”, “Takumi-kun 2. Rainbow glow”, “U”, “Miles &amp; Kyler”, “boys are being naughty”. The court pointed out that each of these videos depicted kisses either between two men or two women; these videos were “related to the promotion of non-traditional sexual relations of the LGBT community” and were of “an extremist nature”.</dataout:hasSnippet>
