    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">Yan Dvorkin, head of the support centre for transgender and non-binary people, “Center-T”, was fined for a Telegram post announcing a marriage with such phrases as “So, gay marriages are here to stay!” and “Our insidious plan to legalise same-sex marriage was successful.” The court found Yan's post to be “promoting non-traditional sexual relationships” because the judicial expertise concluded that it presented relationships “not between a man and a woman” in a positive light and characterised such relationships as “natural”. The picture is a screenshot of the post mentioned in the court order.</dataout:hasSnippet>
