    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for a 15-second video. The court described the video showing “a young man with long hair, headphones, glasses and a black T-shirt moving to music, with the caption: I sing for all the male consultants of Golden Apple [a chain of beauty shops].” The court held that the caption, together with the music, was sufficient to disseminate “propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations”. The same individual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos.</dataout:hasSnippet>
