    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The online marketplace “Wildberries” was fined for selling sex toys online, as well as other products containing references to “non-traditional sexual relations”, such as the books “Straight Talk About Homosexuality. The Other Side of Tolerance” (Richard Cohen, 2010) and “Violent Love” (Gerry Oster, 1991).</dataout:hasSnippet>
