    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The company “DotDTechnology”, which owns the TV channel “Clubbing TV”, was fined for distributing two music videos. The court found them to contain material “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations”. The titles of the music videos have been redacted in the court ruling.</dataout:hasSnippet>
