    <dataout:hasPenalty>
      <dataout:Penalty rdf:about="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_fine_ce17b729">
        <dataout:penaltyCategory rdf:resource="https://dataout.org/ontology#fine"/>
      </dataout:Penalty>
    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A VKontakte user was fined for publishing a picture in 2018, which depicted “kissing women bathing together half-naked in a bathtub.” As the judicial expert concluded, this image “contained psychological and linguistic signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, expressed in attracting interest and forming sexual attitudes towards non-traditional sexual relations.” The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling. The same individual was fined by the same judge on the same day at least twice for pictures on VK (see also 5-0265/2025).</dataout:hasSnippet>
