    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The editor-in-chief of “Clubbing TV” was fined for airing several music videos labelled “16+.” According to Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, these videos “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, including descriptions, depictions of non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, or capable of causing a desire in minors to change sex, using mass media.” The court did not specify which videos or scenes violated the law.</dataout:hasSnippet>
