    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A Tajikistan national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on a website with the nickname “Mika TS”, which authorities qualified as the dissemination of information demonstrating “non-traditional sexual relations”.</dataout:hasSnippet>
