    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An Uzbekistan citizen was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting “text messages about the provision of intimate services for non-traditional relationships” on VKontakte. The court stated that the messages “promoted non-traditional sexual relations and preferences” because their author “has a homosexual position ('vers', 'pass'), sexual orientation - gay,” and they were accompanied by “a nude photo of a man offering non-traditional sexual relations.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
