    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An activist was prosecuted for reposting English-language mass media articles on her social media and publishing posts about the organisation “The Youth Coalition for Sexual and Reproductive Rights”. The authorities translated the articles into Russian using an online translation tool and concluded that they promoted “non-traditional sexual relations” among minors. The articles were “Ireland becomes first country to legalise gay marriage by popular vote” by The Guardian and “Russian LGBT Activists March In 'Rainbow May Day'” by BuzzFeed.</dataout:hasSnippet>
