    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The editor-in-chief of the music TV channel “La Minor TV” was fined for airing the music video “Город” (“The City”, 2013) by the band “Tantsy Minus”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, determined that the music video “contains scenes of affection and tactile gestures, as well as scenes of kissing between two persons of the same biological sex (female), therefore contains information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences.” The judicial expertise also involved the analysis of the kiss scene. The experts applied the so-called “classification of kisses”, which includes “social and sensual kisses, the latter differing depending on the types of feelings (kisses of affection, tenderness, respect and kisses of love).” The company that owns the TV channel was also fined for the same music video (see case 05-6777/2023).</dataout:hasSnippet>
