        <dataout:penaltyValue>
          <schema:MonetaryAmount rdf:nodeID="nb339817b2c8941f983f86810fb398ca2b188">
            <schema:currency>RUB</schema:currency>
            <schema:value rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">150000</schema:value>
          </schema:MonetaryAmount>
        </dataout:penaltyValue>
      </dataout:Penalty>
    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for a 15-second TikTok video. In this clip, the court described the defendant “wearing headphones, glasses, a white T-shirt and black jacket, moving to music while text appeared on screen”. The exact text is unknown. Officers testified that the original TikTok post had already been deleted, but the video spread to Telegram channels. The same individual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos.</dataout:hasSnippet>
