    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">Yuliya Tsvetkova, an artist and activist from Komsomolsk-on-Amur, was fined for two social media posts expressing support for young subscribers of the VKontakte group “The Last Supper – LGBTQIAP+on-Amur” accompanied by images of cartoon cats coloured in queer flags. Yulia appealed the court decision twice, but the cassation court upheld the punishment.</dataout:hasSnippet>
