    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on a website for trans women escorts. According to the police protocol, the creator of the profile, “being a male, writes about himself in the feminine gender [...] publicly expressing his interest in the attractiveness of non-traditional relationships” by posting “information about the cost of intimate services, personal physiological data, and terms of service provision.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
