    <dataout:hasPenalty rdf:resource="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_expulsion_7f3450a1"/>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A Tajikistan citizen was detained for 15 days and ordered to leave the country for posting “an ad offering sexual services in a non-traditional form” on VKontakte. The court found the post to be promoting “non-traditional sexual relations” because it contained the text “Transsexual Sochi versatile big active [phone number]” supplemented by nude images, while indicating [the defendant's] male identity.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
