    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The streaming service “Premier” was fined for distributing the film “#Iamhere” (2019, Éric Lartigau). According to the ruling, the platform had disseminated “information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, including description and depiction of non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences”. The exact scenes of the film in question are unclear.</dataout:hasSnippet>
