    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The legal entity “FONBET TV”, which owns the music TV channel “TNT Music”, was fined for airing the music video “Summer Really Hurt Us” (2022) by ALMA, labelled “16+”. According to the court, the video contained “information depicting non-traditional sexual relationships and/or preferences that is prohibited for distribution to children.” The scene that violated the law was “an image of two individuals of the same biological sex (female) kissing.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
