    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A foreign national was detained and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on the social media website “Drug Vokrug”. According to the court, the profile owner “being a male, posts photos of himself in a women's dress and a long-haired wig, and refers to himself in the feminine gender”, suggesting “intimate services for non-traditional relations”.</dataout:hasSnippet>
