          </schema:MonetaryAmount>
        </dataout:penaltyValue>
      </dataout:Penalty>
    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The editor-in-chief of the online mass media “7×7 — Horizontal Russia” was fined for six publications from 2021. Based on the “psycho-linguistic” expert analysis, the court deemed the publications to be “promoting non-traditional sexual relationships”. It is unclear what exactly constituted the violation. The titles of the publications were redacted in the court decision. Based on the indicated time of the publications, we identified one of them, titled “‘This is some kind of cave-like savagery.’ An unidentified individual attacked LGBT activists with a spray can in the city centre of Yaroslavl” from 12.06.2021.</dataout:hasSnippet>
