    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An admin of a VKontakte page about gay dating was fined for “propaganda among minors of non-traditional sexual relations”. According to the mass media, the individual administered the VK page until 2010, and the content was posted to the page by its members. Other details of the case are unknown; the court did not publish the decision.</dataout:hasSnippet>
