    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a video on the social media platform “Odnoklassniki”. The video, according to the court, “was aimed at forming non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences, and a distorted understanding of the social validity of traditional and non-traditional sexual relationships.” The case was brought to court by the police unit, which specialises in “fighting against ethnic criminal groups”. The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown.</dataout:hasSnippet>
