    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for a video published on TikTok. According to the court, this video “promoted non-traditional sexual relations” and depicted “a young man with headphones on, long hair, glasses in a black T-shirt, and text over it”; “[the defendant] himself is present in the video, [...] moving to the music”. It is not said what text was on the video. The same indivudual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos.</dataout:hasSnippet>
