    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The product manager of the streaming service “More.tv” was fined for the TV series “The Shannara Chronicles” (Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, 2016) with the age restriction label “16+”. According to Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, the series “contains information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” among minors. The court did not specify which scenes exactly constituted the violation.</dataout:hasSnippet>
    <dataout:hasTriggerObject rdf:resource="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#64122"/>
