    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on the trans women escort website. The court decision states that the profile was “aimed at developing non-traditional sexual relations” because its creator, “being a male, posts photos of himself in female guise, specifically in women's clothing (a skirt), with signs of female breasts, with long blond hair, makeup, and with exposed male genitalia (penis).”</dataout:hasSnippet>
