    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The editor-in-chief of the music TV channel “ТNТ MUSIC” was fined for airing the music video “Hallucination” by Regard and Years &amp; Years. According to the court, the music video “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” among minors, because the TV channel marked it “16+”. It is not specified which scenes exactly constituted the violation.</dataout:hasSnippet>
