    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was fined for publishing an explicit video. The court stated that “the video depicted two women engaging in mutual caresses and kissing each other on the lips, thereby promoting non-traditional sexual relations.”</dataout:hasSnippet>
