    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The company “DotDTechnology”, which owns the TV channel “Clubbing TV”, was fined for airing three music videos: “Flash” by Lewis OfMan (2018), “For Love” by filous feat. klei (2018), and “La Lueur” by Holism (2022). According to the court, these videos “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences to minors” because they were labelled “16+”. It is not specified what scenes exactly constituted the violation.</dataout:hasSnippet>
