            <schema:value rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">100000</schema:value>
          </schema:MonetaryAmount>
        </dataout:penaltyValue>
      </dataout:Penalty>
    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The editor-in-chief of the music TV channel “O2TV” was fined for airing the music video “Крылья” (“Wings”) by “Dezery”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, determined that the music video “vividly demonstrates the main character's conscious rejection of traditional sexual relations; she is willing to confront her mother and the entire world. The communicative purpose of [the video] is to create a distorted perception of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences.” The company, which owns the TV channel, was also fined for the same music video (see case 05-7506/2023).</dataout:hasSnippet>
