    <dataout:hasDefendant rdf:resource="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#individual_0078"/>
    <dataout:hasPenalty>
      <dataout:Penalty rdf:about="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_fine_3c2b98b8">
        <dataout:penaltyCategory rdf:resource="https://dataout.org/ontology#fine"/>
        <dataout:penaltyValue>
          <schema:MonetaryAmount rdf:nodeID="nb339817b2c8941f983f86810fb398ca2b78">
            <schema:currency>RUB</schema:currency>
            <schema:value rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">25000</schema:value>
          </schema:MonetaryAmount>
        </dataout:penaltyValue>
      </dataout:Penalty>
    </dataout:hasPenalty>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A moderator of a VKontakte page was fined, becasue the page “contained text, images, audio, and video […] prohibited for distribution among children, namely, information aimed at denying traditional spiritual, moral, and family values and promoting non-traditional sexual relations”, according to the court. The judicial expertise concluded: “the main theme of this webpage is the recognition of the normality and equivalence of sexual relations between a man and a man, in connection with which indirect signs of distorted ideas about the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations are present.” In court, the defendant explained that this VK page was about dating among homosexual people. The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown.</dataout:hasSnippet>
