    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The website editor of the streaming service “Tricolor Kino i TV Online” was fined for the film “Blow Dry” (2001, Paddy Breathnach) labelled “16+” with a 10-second scene (01:21:47-01:21:57) of “two same-sex characters (female) kissing in a sexual context”, which the court found to be “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relationships to minors.” The legal entity which owns the streaming service was also fined for the same film scene (case 5-493/23).</dataout:hasSnippet>
