    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A VKontakte user was fined for uploading photos of men with “well-developed muscles up to the waist” onto his page. According to the court, these images and text accompanying them promoted “non-traditional sexual relationships” among minors.</dataout:hasSnippet>
