    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The general director of a bar was fined because the bar's page on VKontakte advertised a “venue intended for people of non-traditional sexual orientation”. The judicial expert mentioned that the bar's VK page “promoted the ideology of the LGBT movement prohibited in the Russian Federation.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown.</dataout:hasSnippet>
