    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A Kyrgyzstan citizen was fined and ordered to leave the country for publishing a profile on a website for sex services. According to the court, this individual “promoted non-traditional sexual relations and preferences for sex change.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown.</dataout:hasSnippet>
