    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An individual was prosecuted for posting a textual message on Telegram accompanied by “two images of 'rainbow' flags, similar to the symbols of the international LGBT social movement, which is classified as an extremist organisation”. The court stated that this content was “obviously aimed at forming non-traditional sexual attitudes, the attractiveness of non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, and a distorted idea of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences.” The exact content is unknown.</dataout:hasSnippet>
