    <dataout:hasPenalty rdf:resource="https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_fine_5c55ed39"/>
    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A VKontakte user was fined for publishing a picture depicting “two women promoting non-traditional sexual relations.” The judicial expert stated that the picture “contained psychological and linguistic signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, that is, it is expressed in the popularisation and drawing attention to same-sex female relationships.” The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling. The same individual was fined by the same judge on the same day at least three times for similar pictures on VK (see also 5-0248/2025, 5-0250/2025).</dataout:hasSnippet>
