    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">A VKontakte user was fined for “an image and English-language text commenting on it” published in 2015, which “promoted non-traditional sexual relations among minors”. The court referred to this image as “a comic in the genre of 'sexual comedy, LGBT'.” The exact image is unknown. The same individual was fined twice on the same day by the same judge for publishing images on VK (see also 05-0212/2025).</dataout:hasSnippet>
