    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">The blogger and creator of the Telegram channel “PETROVA” was fined for posts “containing propaganda of sex change, non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences”. The exact posts are not specified. The police drew attention to this case after “The Safe Internet League”, a state-financed nonprofit, brought the blogger's posts to the Prosecutor General's Office.</dataout:hasSnippet>
