    <dataout:hasSnippet xml:lang="en">An activist was fined for his single protest, during which he displayed a banner with the text “Being gay and loving gays is normal, beating gays and killing gays is a crime”. The activist appealed his fine twice, but the Supreme Court of the Republic of Tatarstan still deemed the poster to promote non-traditional sexual relations.</dataout:hasSnippet>
